SUMMARY:Sunday Salsa Bachata at the Rose
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at The Rose every Sunday for our Latin night and dancing!\nThere will be an open level dance class (often a little footwork and then partner work in either salsa or bachata)\, and then a social party after.\nThere is a bar available to purchase drinks.
